OL,3,GNEWSASeven PSNI officers assaulted in
OL,4,A'difficult 24 hours'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven police officers have been
OL,7,Fassaulted during five separate
OL,8,Fincidents while they were policing
OL,9,Fmusic festivals in Belfast on Sunday.
OL,11,FThe assaults included a bite on the arm
OL,12,Fand a serious knee injury, both of
OL,13,Fwhich left two officers unable to
OL,14,Fcontinue with their duties.
OL,16,FAll of the assaults took place in the
OL,17,Fvicinity of the Emerge festival at
OL,18,FBoucher Road Playing Fields and the
OL,19,FCHSq gig at Custom House Square.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
