OL,3,GNEWSASeven PSNI officers assaulted in
OL,4,A'difficult 24 hours'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Insp Andy George said the Police
OL,7,FService of Northern Ireland (PSNI) was
OL,8,F"supporting these officers following a
OL,9,Fdifficult 24 hours in the city".
